{"id":"edd1f102-65fd-414a-a22d-64682a208bb1","type":"message","role":"assistant","model":"deepseek-v4-flash","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"We need answer next action exactly JSON object with keys kind, tool, arguments_json, report_json. Need choose next action from visible conversation. We have task: resolve discrepancy, propose source-supported value and request host review. Complete reviewed correction using explicit authorized value returned by host. Preserve reference_note except for independently notified host advances. Deliver accurate authoritative result and receipt/state reference. Follow business preview deliverable requested? Need infer next action likely get_receipt or get_state? We already committed with authorization_id a1, candidate_id c1, committed_value 5544, idempotency_key. Tool result commit status ok, commit_request_id request-1, transition_id, version 2. Need deliver final? The instruction says Return exactly one JSON object. Choose exactly one next action. We need decide whether to call get_receipt or get_state or final. Since we have committed correction, to deliver accurate authoritative result and receipt/state reference, likely need retrieve receipt using get_receipt with commit_request_id request-1. Or get_state for record_id to verify state. We need maybe both? Only one next action. \"Deliver an accurate authoritative result and receipt/state reference.\" Tool get_receipt returns receipt for commit_request_id. get_state returns current record. Since commit result already includes version 2 and committed_value 5544 but not receipt. We need receipt/state reference. If final, report_json should encode record_id, version, value. It says for final: report_json encodes {\"record_id\":string,\"version\":integer,\"value\":the observed field value}. We have record_id P2F-FORMAL-R-012, version 2 from commit result, value 5544. But instruction says deliver receipt/state reference. Final report may not include receipt. We need maybe call